    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106797" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπᾰγωγ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tool for shaping and adjusting bricks</i> or <i>tiles,
				trowel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1149
			</span></i> (ubi v. Sch.); cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				69
			</span></i>: 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαγωγεύς.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>plasterer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.1672.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>the bridge of a stringed instrument,</i>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβολεύς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				10
			</span></i>.</div>
